WEBVTT

00:01.240 --> 00:02.420
Go home.

00:02.420 --> 00:05.150
I don't know how you got in here,

00:05.660 --> 00:08.390
but this is no place for a child like you.

01:42.200 --> 01:46.870
<b>Episode 3
Contracts and Oaths</b>

01:42.200 --> 01:46.870
<b>Episode 3
Contracts and Oaths</b>

01:43.280 --> 01:47.170
I'm the owner of this 
trading company, Mulan.

01:47.170 --> 01:49.850
This is Mr. Takumi Iruma.

01:49.850 --> 01:51.910
He's looking for a slave.

01:51.910 --> 01:53.830
P-Pleased to meet you.

01:53.830 --> 02:00.140
Though Mr. Takumi here is reluctant 
to make use of a slave contract.

02:00.140 --> 02:01.550
Reluctant?

02:01.920 --> 02:07.220
Contracting a slave is something that just 
wasn't done in the land I was born in.

02:07.220 --> 02:08.610
I see.

02:08.610 --> 02:12.450
It's true that if you would be to 
form a contract with a slave,

02:12.450 --> 02:15.060
that slave would be bound to your service.

02:15.060 --> 02:16.040
Uh-huh...

02:16.040 --> 02:19.710
However, here in the 
Kingdom of Barcula at least,

02:19.710 --> 02:22.380
slaves' rights are protected.

02:22.660 --> 02:27.710
<i>The general gist of the slave contract 
that she explained to me went like this:</i>

02:28.880 --> 02:31.790
<i>The owner pledges to honor 
the slave's general rights</i>

02:31.790 --> 02:34.770
<i>and provide food, clothing, and shelter.</i>

02:35.200 --> 02:39.000
<i>Both parties are forbidden from causing 
life-threatening harm to one another.</i>

02:39.000 --> 02:42.110
<i>Forcing the slave to perform actions not 
outlined in the contract is forbidden.</i>

02:42.480 --> 02:47.100
<i>The slave is prohibited from sharing 
information about their owner to others.</i>

02:47.930 --> 02:52.020
<i>Now I see. That's different from 
what I imagined for a slave.</i>

02:52.020 --> 02:57.150
Now, allow me to explain the 
common types of contracts.

02:57.150 --> 03:00.780
Those who become slaves due to 
debt, regardless of reason,

03:00.780 --> 03:03.890
form a contract that lasts 
until they repay their debts.

03:04.370 --> 03:10.070
Criminals can accept a contract in order to 
reform and secure a means to earn a living.

03:10.070 --> 03:16.050
Prisoners of war can accept a 
contract to earn a place to live.

03:16.050 --> 03:18.920
There are also contracts formed 
with those attacked and captured

03:18.920 --> 03:22.500
by thieves or bandits who illegally 
forced them into slavery.

03:22.500 --> 03:24.150
Those are the common ones.

03:24.150 --> 03:28.980
For Mr. Takumi, it would be preferable 
to have one of the war slaves,

03:28.980 --> 03:31.960
since they cannot be freed without 
their master's permission.

03:31.960 --> 03:33.930
May I ask why?

03:33.930 --> 03:34.660
Oh!

03:34.660 --> 03:40.780
Mr. Iruma is a producer with skill and 
talent that others cannot hope to mimic!

03:40.780 --> 03:44.110
Mr. Iruma, what is <i>your</i> opinion?

03:44.110 --> 03:46.330
I <i>am</i> a producer,

03:46.330 --> 03:49.610
so I'd like to focus on my 
work as much as possible,

03:49.610 --> 03:52.320
but I also have to fulfill quests 
from the Adventurer's Guild,

03:52.320 --> 03:55.590
and I'm currently struggling 
to handle my daily affairs.

03:56.230 --> 03:59.690
I'd like to have someone who can manage 
the mansion I'm currently living in,

03:59.690 --> 04:02.040
and help handle all of the housework.

04:02.550 --> 04:05.600
I also have many skills that 
should be kept confidential,

04:05.600 --> 04:08.260
so I can't promise that 
trouble won't find me.

04:08.640 --> 04:12.830
On top of that, I imagine I will venture into
 dangerous places to gather materials,

04:12.830 --> 04:15.070
so in addition to protecting me,

04:15.070 --> 04:19.020
it would be nice if they're able to fight 
and accompany me during such harvests.

04:19.020 --> 04:21.950
Managing a mansion and combat 
plus bodyguard work...

04:22.380 --> 04:24.980
That means you're looking for two slaves, then.

04:26.840 --> 04:29.000
P-Pardon me.

04:32.360 --> 04:33.930
I'm Maria!

04:33.930 --> 04:37.870
Maria was kidnapped by bandits when she 
was very young and has no family left.

04:37.870 --> 04:42.840
We've trained in reading, writing, 
calculations, and general housekeeping.

04:42.840 --> 04:45.010
This is Mr. Takumi Iruma.

04:45.010 --> 04:47.800
He's looking for someone 
who can manage a mansion.

04:48.360 --> 04:49.510
Yes!

04:49.510 --> 04:53.970
Uh, the mansion has a living room, 
dining room, and kitchen on the first floor.

04:53.970 --> 04:56.890
The second floor has four 
bedrooms and a bathroom.

04:56.890 --> 04:59.030
Would that be hard to handle by yourself?

05:00.050 --> 05:03.700
I should be able to handle 
that many rooms by myself!

05:03.700 --> 05:05.270
I'm glad to hear it.

05:05.270 --> 05:06.480
What is it?

05:06.480 --> 05:12.210
Well, I figure someone as cute as you 
would have plenty of takers, so well...

05:12.210 --> 05:14.030
why are you still available?

05:14.030 --> 05:16.370
C-Cute?!

05:17.190 --> 05:19.330
Th-That was inappropriate of me!

05:19.330 --> 05:24.450
Um! I can only do general housekeeping!

05:24.450 --> 05:26.570
Yes, that's what I want...

05:26.570 --> 05:28.310
I can't do anything else!

05:28.580 --> 05:30.010
"Anything else"?

05:30.010 --> 05:34.230
L-Like, well... sleeping with you.

05:36.680 --> 05:39.720
Or sleeping with you!  Or sleeping with you!

05:39.720 --> 05:40.770
No, no, no!

05:40.770 --> 05:42.530
I don't need that from you!

05:42.530 --> 05:45.120
Are you okay with me just 
handling housekeeping?!

05:45.120 --> 05:46.570
Of course!

05:46.570 --> 05:48.310
Even though you can't sleep with me?!

05:48.310 --> 05:50.040
That would be wrong!

05:50.380 --> 05:55.240
Then shall we proceed with 
your contract with Maria?

05:55.240 --> 05:57.960
Yes! If Maria's is agreeable.

05:57.960 --> 06:00.700
Th-Thank you for having me!

06:01.400 --> 06:04.370
Now, as for the other one 
you're looking for...

06:04.790 --> 06:07.840
Unfortunately, we don't have 
any war slaves right now.

06:08.310 --> 06:10.550
But you have Sofia, don't you?

06:10.550 --> 06:13.500
This isn't something for you to butt in on.

06:13.500 --> 06:14.770
But—

06:14.770 --> 06:17.250
Return to your room and 
ready your belongings.

06:17.880 --> 06:18.990
Yes...

06:22.370 --> 06:23.980
Is there someone?

06:23.980 --> 06:26.510
Yes. Though she has problems.

06:27.420 --> 06:28.500
<i>What's this?</i>

06:28.500 --> 06:30.010
<i>I'm really curious now.</i>

06:30.550 --> 06:33.950
We will contact you as soon as we find 
someone who meets your criteria, Mr. Iruma.

06:33.120 --> 06:35.320
Would it be possible to meet her?

06:35.720 --> 06:36.650
Huh?

06:37.470 --> 06:39.340
<i>Maybe this is due to...</i>

06:38.710 --> 06:41.000
<b>Passive Skill</b>

06:38.710 --> 06:41.000
<b>Intuition</b>

06:39.340 --> 06:40.730
<i>my Intuition skill?</i>

06:41.570 --> 06:44.630
<i>I have a strong urge telling 
me not to back down.</i>

06:45.330 --> 06:47.180
<i>There was Maria's expression, too.</i>

06:47.910 --> 06:51.270
<i>At any rate... I'll try 
following these instincts.</i>

06:57.610 --> 06:59.560
She was captured during the war

06:59.890 --> 07:04.770
between the Kingdom of Triaria and the
 Kingdom of Yughur roughly 50 years ago.

07:04.770 --> 07:06.220
<i>Fifty</i> years ago?!

07:06.530 --> 07:09.290
The Kingdom of Yughur was a nation of elves.

07:09.290 --> 07:13.940
For various reasons, she has not formed 
a contract with anyone thus far.

07:13.940 --> 07:15.410
Like what?

07:15.410 --> 07:18.540
She has a large scar on her left ear.

07:18.540 --> 07:21.760
Also, her right hand and left leg 
 have impaired movement.

07:21.760 --> 07:24.540
Although not so impaired as to
 cause issues with her daily life.

07:25.370 --> 07:31.850
She's also had the elemental magic and 
sprite magic unique to elves sealed away.

07:32.190 --> 07:35.600
She was likely placed 
under some kind of curse.

07:35.600 --> 07:39.290
These are all fatal flaws 
for a main combatant.

07:39.710 --> 07:44.510
Um, may I speak with her for a bit?

07:46.980 --> 07:47.970
As you wish.

07:47.970 --> 07:49.540
Mulan!

07:49.540 --> 07:52.430
Take care not to be rude to our customer.

07:57.450 --> 07:59.110
My name is Takumi.

07:59.960 --> 08:05.540
As she just explained, 
I won't be of any use to you.

08:05.540 --> 08:07.510
Please excuse me.

08:07.510 --> 08:09.510
Wh-What are you—?!

08:10.450 --> 08:13.570
<i>I'm not a fan of peeking 
at others' status, but...</i>

08:14.930 --> 08:19.890
<b>m 0 0 l 26 0 26 50 0 50</b>

08:14.930 --> 08:19.890
<b>m 0 0 l 80 0 80 20 0 20</b>

