Lv3</b>

08:14.930 --> 08:19.890
<b>Active Skills</b>

08:14.930 --> 08:19.890
<b>Swordsmanship Lv7, Shieldmanship Lv5,
Spearmanship Lv6, Bowmanship Lv6,
Martial Arts Lv4, Enemy Detection Lv2,
Sense Presence Lv2, Stealth Lv2,
Physical Enhancement Lv4, Sense Magic Lv6,
Mana Manipulation Lv5, Sprite Magic Lv8,
Water Magic Lv5, Wind Magic Lv6</b>

08:15.630 --> 08:19.400
<i>This woman is </i>crazy<i> strong!</i>

08:19.890 --> 08:24.350
m 0 0 l 200 0 200 60 0 60

08:19.890 --> 08:24.350
<b>Notes</b>

08:19.890 --> 08:24.350
<b>Due to limb impairment,
all Stats are reduced by
100. Due to Curse of
Exorcism, mana cannot
be used.</b>

08:20.270 --> 08:24.360
<i>If I'm able to heal the impairment 
in her limbs and dispel the curse...</i>

08:24.360 --> 08:26.600
<i>then she'll actually an 
immediate fighting asset!</i>

08:29.060 --> 08:32.030
What do you think, after talking with her?

08:32.030 --> 08:32.920
Yes!

08:34.180 --> 08:36.430
I want to form a contract with her.

08:36.430 --> 08:39.260
You heard her, though! I can't fight!

08:39.810 --> 08:43.210
I just need to do something about 
the reason behind that, right?

08:45.890 --> 08:47.370
Mr. Iruma!

08:47.370 --> 08:52.280
You're saying you can do something about the 
issues that have shackled her for over 50 years?

08:52.280 --> 08:53.130
Yes!

08:53.720 --> 08:56.850
I'm almost at the level I need.

09:01.240 --> 09:02.730
Interesting!

09:02.730 --> 09:06.780
Then I'll happily entrust 
Sofia to you, Mr. Iruma.

09:06.780 --> 09:08.360
Mulan!

09:08.360 --> 09:13.730
Oh, Sofia, please be honest and let us know 
if you absolutely can't stand me or something!

09:15.930 --> 09:19.810
There's no need for you to 
confirm a slave's wishes.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.540
Everything is in order.

09:26.540 --> 09:28.920
That concludes all the office paperwork.

09:30.550 --> 09:34.250
Master, I'm truly so very grateful!

09:34.250 --> 09:35.030
Huh?

09:35.660 --> 09:39.170
I'm so happy that you're 
contracting Sofia along with me!

09:41.960 --> 09:47.050
Now then, let's cast the magic 
as proof of the contract.

10:11.670 --> 10:14.300
The contract is now complete.

10:14.540 --> 10:18.990
Master, I'll work hard so that you'll 
keep me for many long years.

10:18.990 --> 10:20.500
No, that's fine!

10:20.920 --> 10:24.210
Master, thank you for having me.

10:24.440 --> 10:29.440
Oh, no, thank you for 
joining me, Sofia, Maria.

10:29.900 --> 10:31.910
Please stop being so polite 
and respectful with us.

10:31.910 --> 10:35.320
Oh, right! Got it.

10:34.360 --> 10:36.860
<i>Looks like you've found a good master,</i>

10:37.450 --> 10:39.650
<i>Sofia and Maria.</i>

10:41.760 --> 10:43.110
I'm home—

10:44.270 --> 10:45.860
<i>Welcome home!</i>

10:46.430 --> 10:47.830
Master?!

10:48.190 --> 10:50.190
Maria! That's a monster!

10:50.190 --> 10:51.430
Wait! Wait!

10:51.430 --> 10:52.990
She's my pet!

10:52.990 --> 10:54.690
Her name is Maple!

10:54.690 --> 10:57.200
Maple, this is Sofia and Maria.

10:57.200 --> 10:59.000
They'll be living with us starting today.

10:59.000 --> 11:00.540
<i>Live with us?</i>

11:00.540 --> 11:03.900
You have a Killer Spider... as a pet?

11:05.550 --> 11:07.580
Would you like to use this room?

11:07.980 --> 11:09.680
It's a nice room.

11:09.680 --> 11:11.450
The room next door can be Maria's.

11:11.450 --> 11:13.940
Huh? We each get our own room?!

11:14.210 --> 11:15.160
Yeah.

11:15.160 --> 11:17.390
We couldn't. That's far too luxurious.

11:17.390 --> 11:22.000
There are plenty of rooms in this mansion, 
so it'd help me if you used some.

11:22.750 --> 11:25.380
In here, there's a large bath!

11:25.380 --> 11:28.340
Once you're done unpacking, 
you can use it whenever you like.

11:28.340 --> 11:29.930
Use the bath?!

11:29.930 --> 11:32.230
Then you should use it first, Master.

11:32.230 --> 11:36.300
Hm, but I don't really have 
a set time I take my bath.

11:36.540 --> 11:41.010
Besides, the bath uses a magical device 
to constantly keep it clean,

11:41.010 --> 11:43.360
so it doesn't matter what who uses it first.

11:46.970 --> 11:48.670
The water's so nice!

11:49.040 --> 11:54.250
Honestly, I thought Madame Mulan 
would never let you go.

11:54.810 --> 11:58.160
She's never given a customer 
her agreement before,

11:58.160 --> 12:00.310
no matter how much money
she was offered for you.

12:00.700 --> 12:03.830
Yet Mulan has acknowledged this master.

12:04.990 --> 12:07.650
I'm glad! He seems like a kind person!

12:08.630 --> 12:10.030
Sofia?

12:11.060 --> 12:15.910
I caught a glance of the contract Mulan 
prepared at the trading company.

12:16.920 --> 12:20.120
Most of our master's entries were blank.

12:20.120 --> 12:22.220
Even his birthplace and lineage.

12:22.460 --> 12:23.980
They were blank?

12:23.980 --> 12:28.320
If he's concealing that much, then there are 
either some special circumstances at work,

12:28.690 --> 12:30.790
or sharing more would bring trouble.

12:33.610 --> 12:35.650
<i>What is he thinking?</i>

12:41.530 --> 12:43.470
Th-This is...

12:43.470 --> 12:44.990
Yeah, it's dinner.

12:46.260 --> 12:48.190
Maria? What's wrong?

12:48.190 --> 12:51.520
M-My job!

12:51.520 --> 12:52.070
Huh?!

12:52.070 --> 12:53.160
And yet!

12:53.160 --> 12:55.400
And yet you did it all, Master!

12:55.760 --> 12:58.850
Now I'm just a toilet in clothing!

12:58.850 --> 13:02.130
No! I'm even lower than that!

13:02.770 --> 13:05.890
L-Look, it's just because 
today's your first day here!

13:05.890 --> 13:08.290
I'll ask you to handle it 
starting tomorrow, Maria!

13:08.290 --> 13:09.190
Okay?

13:09.190 --> 13:12.130
Please let me start with 
the cleanup afterwards!

13:12.130 --> 13:14.810
Yes, happily! For now, let's eat!

13:15.410 --> 13:18.530
You're having us sit with you for meals?

13:19.060 --> 13:21.070
That would be considered rude.

13:21.360 --> 13:25.950
Listen, I don't want to do everything 
separate just because you're serving me.

13:25.950 --> 13:30.070
I understand you might be hesitant, 
but I'd be happy if you went along with it.

13:30.070 --> 13:33.920
Um, if that's how you feel, Master.

13:33.920 --> 13:39.380
Also, I'm not really used to being called "Master," 
so could you just call me by name?

13:39.860 --> 13:42.280
Is that an order?

13:42.900 --> 13:46.300
No, nothing major like that.

13:46.300 --> 13:48.040
Just, if you could.

13:48.040 --> 13:49.820
Then, Mr. Takumi!

13:49.820 --> 13:52.100
Yeah. Now, let's eat up!

13:52.100 --> 13:54.430
Yes! Thank you for the food!

13:55.560 --> 13:57.520
<b>Papek Trading Company</b>

13:57.780 --> 14:00.970
Here are the items you ordered.

14:00.970 --> 14:06.200
I've wrapped them very securely, 
so please be careful when handling them.

14:06.560 --> 14:07.780
I understand.

14:07.780 --> 14:09.170
Thank you very much.

14:15.510 --> 14:17.780
Is that a church?

14:20.800 --> 14:22.890
I never noticed it before.

14:29.940 --> 14:31.320
Lady Nolyn.

14:34.020 --> 14:37.050
<i>Thank you so much for all your blessings.</i>

14:38.170 --> 14:40.300
<i>Though...</i>

14:40.610 --> 14:45.660
<i>I've heard the Holy Empire of Sidonia 
controls the religion of this country,</i>

14:46.040 --> 14:49.040
<i>so why were you badmouthing 
Sidonia, Lady Nolyn?</i>

14:49.560 --> 14:51.290
Because I'm not a part of it.

14:52.540 --> 14:54.710
Been a while, Takumi!

14:54.710 --> 14:58.660
L-Lady Nolyn?! H-How?!

14:58.980 --> 15:01.830
You offered me your prayer, 
so I called you up nice and quick!

15:01.830 --> 15:03.200
Nice and quick?

15:03.200 --> 15:06.340
So I'll answer your question 
nice and quick, too.

15:06.340 --> 15:09.760
I have nothing to do with Sidonia 
and their Church of Divine Light.

15:10.620 --> 15:11.550
Huh?

15:12.090 --> 15:14.590
<i>According to her nice and quick explanation,</i>

15:14.590 --> 15:16.900
<i>there are two religions in this world:</i>

15:16.900 --> 15:19.570
<i>the Church of Creation and 
the Church of Divine Light.</i>

15:20.430 --> 15:24.110
<i>The Church of Creation has always 
worshiped Lady Nolyn from the start.</i>

15:24.110 --> 15:28.590
<i>The Church of Divine Light was created later,
 along with its god that doesn't exist.</i>

15:29.130 --> 15:33.470
<i>After its founding, the Holy Empire 
of Sidonia used forceful means</i>

15:33.470 --> 15:36.430
<i>to rapidly spread the influence 
of the Church of Divine Light,</i>

15:36.430 --> 15:38.730
<i>and they opposed the Church of Creation,</i>

15:38.730 --> 15:44.440
<i>but Lady Nolyn said she wouldn't interfere 
in all the petty affairs of humanity.</i>

15:45.450 --> 15:50.240
<i>So, as a result, Sidonia was able to activate 
their otherworlder summoning spell,</i>

15:50.240 --> 15:54.290
<i>and that led to the accident where someone 
like me—who wasn't a target—got summoned, too.</i>

15:54.290 --> 15:57.880
L-Like I said! That's why 
I gave you my super blessing!

15:58.570 --> 16:03.290
Takumi, while the blessing I granted 
as an apology will last forever...

16:03.600 --> 16:05.820
As you expand your world,

16:05.820 --> 16:10.370
the part of the blessing that helped you 
grow and meet people will come undone.

16:10.780 --> 16:11.540
Huh?

16:12.320 --> 16:17.060
To make it simple, your tutorial for 
beginners is nearly over.

16:17.550 --> 16:20.680
You'll find yourself hitting walls 
when it would have been easier before,

16:20.680 --> 16:25.300
and you might start encountering those 
with ill intent who would do you harm.

16:25.300 --> 16:26.890
<i>I see.</i>

16:26.890 --> 16:28.550
<i>It did feel too perfectly orchestrated</i>

16:28.550 --> 16:31.100
<i>with all the nice people and 
places I've encountered so far.</i>

16:31.100 --> 16:33.570
<i>So it was all thanks to her blessing.</i>

16:35.240 --> 16:38.600
Everything is up to you now, Takumi.

16:39.470 --> 16:45.140
<i>That means it's up to me to determine 
how events play out from now on, huh?</i>

16:49.900 --> 16:52.860
<b>The Holy Empire of Sidonia, One Year Later</b>

16:56.370 --> 16:59.800
How are the heroes we summoned?

16:59.800 --> 17:05.360
The three are currently training 
with Sir Homer and Sir Packard.

17:05.790 --> 17:08.520
It was quite a undertaking
 to summon these heroes.

17:08.520 --> 17:11.500
We'll need them to become 
a great strength for us.

17:11.800 --> 17:16.900
They were hesitant due to their 
confusion following their summoning,

17:16.900 --> 17:21.960
but I think they've grown more positive about
 aiding us after Lady Elizabeth's persuasion.

17:26.090 --> 17:27.230
Not enough!

17:27.230 --> 17:29.500
Drive it in harder, Sir Akira!

17:31.780 --> 17:32.990
Sir Yamato!

17:32.990 --> 17:35.560
If you keep that up, then you'll 
fall on the battlefield!

17:36.340 --> 17:38.280
Is that all you've got?

17:40.690 --> 17:41.700
Point!

17:43.880 --> 17:47.240
Our favorite to win, Yamato, 
just lost to a first-year.

17:47.240 --> 17:50.680
He's finished.

17:51.590 --> 17:52.780
I'm...

17:53.480 --> 17:55.080
not done yet!

17:55.080 --> 17:57.460
<i>Now that's how a hero should be!</i>

17:58.290 --> 18:00.560
Now, you too, Lady Akane.

18:00.560 --> 18:03.490
I don't really like violence.

18:03.490 --> 18:05.380
This is not violence.

18:07.170 --> 18:09.590
This is the strength needed 
to save our world.

18:09.950 --> 18:11.770
Don't worry, Akane.

18:12.760 --> 18:15.740
No matter what happens, I'll protect you!

18:16.260 --> 18:18.690
Such a reliable ally.

18:19.590 --> 18:22.380
<i>This woman is dangerous!</i>

18:24.010 --> 18:25.240
I'm home—

18:26.110 --> 18:28.140
<i>Welcome home!</i>

18:29.300 --> 18:32.100
Mr. Takumi! Are you okay?!

18:32.100 --> 18:33.740
I-I'm alright.

18:35.340 --> 18:36.890
<i>Into Item Box!</i>

18:40.230 --> 18:43.710
Uh, I'm going to hole up 
in my workshop for a bit,

18:43.710 --> 18:45.890
so you three have dinner without me.

18:45.890 --> 18:47.210
Understood.

18:46.340 --> 18:48.200
<i>That package...</i>

18:49.520 --> 18:51.130
<i>was wrapped in magical wrapping paper.</i>

18:52.140 --> 18:53.770
<i>What is he hiding?</i>

18:59.510 --> 19:02.260
This is quite the...

19:03.420 --> 19:04.970
Okay! Next!

19:11.340 --> 19:15.800
Heal and Cure!

19:16.730 --> 19:18.890
Th-This is crazy, isn't it?!

19:18.890 --> 19:20.890
But I have to do it!

19:21.460 --> 19:23.720
I have to level up my skill!

19:24.070 --> 19:26.630
Man, what Maria did was cruel, too.

19:28.690 --> 19:30.170
Sofia?!

19:33.280 --> 19:37.580
What are you planning to do to Maria?!

19:37.890 --> 19:44.290
I-If anything happens to Maria, I'll—

19:44.940 --> 19:46.400
Sofia?!

19:48.000 --> 19:50.460
<b>Condition</b>

19:48.000 --> 19:50.460
<b>Extreme Exhaustion</b>

19:48.000 --> 19:50.460
<b>Wounded Left Hand
(Light Wound)</b>

19:48.590 --> 19:50.450
<i>Exhaustion?!</i>

19:50.450 --> 19:53.350
<i>For now, I should at least treat 
the injury to her left hand.</i>

19:55.980 --> 19:59.130
<i>Even though it's a light wound, 
this resistance is incredible!</i>

19:59.130 --> 20:02.010
<i>Is this because of the curse on her?</i>

20:07.400 --> 20:09.190
I managed to heal it.

20:08.890 --> 20:11.310
<b>Skill</b>

20:08.890 --> 20:11.310
<b>Light Magic</b>

20:08.890 --> 20:11.310
<b>has Leveled Up</b>

20:10.190 --> 20:11.320
Yes!

20:12.050 --> 20:14.830
Has she been like this for a while?

20:14.830 --> 20:15.680
Yes.

20:15.680 --> 20:20.280
Suddenly moving around or getting too 
excited will leave her extremely tired.

20:20.280 --> 20:24.020
It's likely due to the curse on her.

20:26.780 --> 20:27.970
Dispel.

20:31.300 --> 20:32.820
Extra Heal.

20:48.700 --> 20:52.470
Sofia should be able to 
fight like she could before.

20:57.960 --> 20:59.390
Sofia!

20:59.390 --> 21:02.320
How do you feel? 
Does anything hurt?

21:03.040 --> 21:06.770
No... My body actually feels light.

21:07.130 --> 21:08.700
Thank goodness!

21:08.700 --> 21:11.520
What am I... doing here?

21:11.520 --> 21:13.990
Mr. Takumi carried you up here!

21:14.430 --> 21:15.940
Maria, run!

21:15.940 --> 21:18.710
That man isn't the man you think he is!

21:18.710 --> 21:22.410
Yes! He's an even better 
person than I imagined!

21:22.410 --> 21:24.870
What?! Has he seduced you?!

21:24.870 --> 21:27.060
Sofia. Your left ear.

21:27.680 --> 21:28.810
Huh?

21:28.810 --> 21:29.970
<i>It can't be!</i>

21:34.720 --> 21:37.360
<i>My magic is... back?</i>

21:37.360 --> 21:39.310
You're all cured!

21:39.310 --> 21:41.230
I'm truly so happy!

21:42.690 --> 21:44.530
<i>I'm... cured?</i>

21:46.200 --> 21:48.730
Are you okay to be up and about already?

21:48.730 --> 21:51.970
Maria said this was all thanks to you.

21:52.690 --> 21:55.510
Uh... let me explain properly.

21:56.010 --> 22:00.470
<i>I explained how I needed one 
more level in my light magic skill</i>

22:00.470 --> 22:02.530
<i>in order to dispel the curse placed on her.</i>

22:03.200 --> 22:05.680
<i>I also explained that the 
fluid in those bottles</i>

22:05.680 --> 22:09.740
<i>was extracted from the highly poisonous 
Nenum herbs which I procured from Papek.</i>

22:10.050 --> 22:14.890
<i>I said I was using it to raise my level by 
repeatedly applying it to a wound and casting Heal.</i>

22:15.850 --> 22:19.760
<i>Then I explained how healing her
exhaustion leveled up my skill</i>

22:19.760 --> 22:23.190
<i>and made me able to use Extra Heal.</i>

22:24.190 --> 22:27.070
And when you said Maria was cruel?

22:27.310 --> 22:30.980
Oh, she thought some
medicinal herbs I organized

22:30.980 --> 22:33.280
were trash and threw them out.

22:33.620 --> 22:36.860
Why did you do such a dangerous thing?

22:38.600 --> 22:40.010
I told you, didn't I?

22:40.010 --> 22:41.690
I'd take care of it.

22:51.140 --> 22:53.160
Huh? Huh?! Wh-What?!

22:53.160 --> 22:55.740
Uh, I guess... I guess I'm sorry!

22:56.930 --> 22:57.780
Huh?!

22:57.780 --> 22:58.890
Sofia?!

22:59.430 --> 23:02.840
I, Sofia Sylphid,

23:02.840 --> 23:08.510
hereby swear my lifelong 
loyalty to you, Takumi Iruma.

23:11.930 --> 23:14.190
Once again, I'm happy to have you.

23:14.990 --> 23:17.240
Yes, Master.

23:21.470 --> 23:22.840
Good, good.

23:35.420 --> 23:39.220
And in Mildgard... roughly one year later...
